title: Workers' Government in Saxony
subtitle: The left SPD in Saxony offers the KPD seats in the state government.
new-page: true
tags: rf_event
view-if: year = 1923 and month >= 10
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: saxony_seen = 1

= Workers' Government in Saxony

Erich Zeigner, the left SPD minister-president of Saxony, invites the KPD into his government. In neighbouring Thuringia a similar offer is on the table. The plan for October counts on these states: KPD ministers could open police arsenals to the Proletarian Hundreds. The Reichswehr is watching.

[? if player_leads : You decide whether the party enters. ?][? if player_leads = 0 : The leadership will decide. You can back the decision or fight it. ?]

- @enter: Enter the government.
- @stay_out: Stay out of a coalition with reformists.
- @back_entry: Support entry.
- @oppose_entry: Oppose entry.

@enter
view-if: player_leads = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.workers_govt = 1;
Q.readiness += 8;
Q.spd_relation += 8;
Q.left_dissent += 6;
Q.right_strength += 3;
!}
go-to: entered

@stay_out
view-if: player_leads = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.workers_govt = 0;
Q.spd_relation -= 6;
Q.right_dissent += 8;
Q[Q.player + '_moscow'] -= 4;
!}

The party stays out. Zeigner governs alone, and Moscow's planners lose their base in central Germany.

@back_entry
view-if: player_leads = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q[Q.player + '_moscow'] += 2;
Q.right_strength += 2;
if (Q.player == 'left') { Q.left_dissent += 5; Q.left_strength -= 3; }
Q.workers_govt = (Q.leader == 'left') ? 0 : 1;
if (Q.workers_govt) { Q.readiness += 8; Q.spd_relation += 8; }
!}
go-to: entered if workers_govt = 1; not_entered if workers_govt = 0

@oppose_entry
view-if: player_leads = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q[Q.player + '_strength'] += 3;
Q[Q.player + '_dissent'] += 4;
Q.workers_govt = (Q.leader == 'left') ? 0 : 1;
if (Q.workers_govt) { Q.readiness += 8; Q.spd_relation += 8; }
!}
go-to: entered if workers_govt = 1; not_entered if workers_govt = 0

@entered

On 10 October, KPD ministers join the Saxon government[? if leader == "right" : , Brandler himself among them ?]. Thuringia follows a few days later. The Proletarian Hundreds are legal in both states. In Berlin, the Reich government and the army command begin to discuss intervention.

@not_entered

The party stays out of the Saxon government. Zeigner governs alone, and Moscow's planners lose their base in central Germany.
